{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16110361","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16110361","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1611036101:0":{"text":"格墨文……","source_cn":"格墨文……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE31D59F415A8DF3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1611036102:0":{"text":"事已至此，你还要隐瞒你的腿伤已经痊愈的事实吗？","source_cn":"事已至此，你还要隐瞒你的腿伤已经痊愈的事实吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89F70C0B31C4B798","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1611036103:0":{"text":"你来找我，是为这个？","source_cn":"你来找我，是为这个？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FF2D7D5F5CC9C52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1611036104:0":{"text":"我的腿伤治不好，这是所有人都知道的事情。","source_cn":"我的腿伤治不好，这是所有人都知道的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF88860E70B659A04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1611036105:0":{"text":"对一个无法行走的人提出这种问题……是一种羞辱。","source_cn":"对一个无法行走的人提出这种问题……是一种羞辱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CCDAAB50AA67546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1611036106:0":{"text":"你那引以为傲的